guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ %b #q.
  (Now( %b ) @ #q)
 ∧
  ((∀ #t. (Tick( %b ) @ #t) ⇒ ¬(#t < #q)) ∨
   (∃ %c #t2. (Tick( %c ) @ #t2) ∧ (%b ⊏ %c) ∧ (#t2 < #q)))"
*/
by sorry

